SudoSigil::checkAction
├── given arbitrary multi-word calldata
│   └── it should return VALIDATION_SUCCESS
├── given selector-only calldata (a 0-argument call)
│   └── it should return VALIDATION_SUCCESS (no reverting slice)
├── given fully empty calldata
│   └── it should return VALIDATION_SUCCESS
├── given a non-zero ETH value
│   └── it should return VALIDATION_SUCCESS (no value cap)
├── given an unconfigured config id
│   └── it should return VALIDATION_SUCCESS (no PolicyNotInitialized guard)
└── given any fuzzed inputs
    └── it should always return VALIDATION_SUCCESS and never revert
